      "id": "7697966239133486343",
      "kind": "organic",
      "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@cohnan/video/7697966239133486343",
      "caption": "🚨 SMASH OR PASS? FAT LOSS FOOD EDITION 🔥 Some foods LOOK healthy but could be making it harder for you to lose those stubborn 30-50 pounds. Here’s what I’d smash vs pass if your goal is to get leaner without starving yourself 👇 🥚 Whole Eggs: SMASH ✅ Great source of healthy fats and nutrients, but not as protein-dense as you might think. 🥜 Mixed Nuts: PASS ❌ Healthy fats, but extremely calorie-dense and way too easy to overeat. 🥣 Nonfat Greek Yogurt: SMASH ✅ High protein, low calorie, and keeps you full for hours. 🧃 Fruit Juice: PASS ❌ Easy to drink hundreds of calories without the filling fiber you’d get from whole fruit. 🥔 Boiled Potatoes: SMASH ✅ One of the most filling foods you can eat. Perfect for keeping hunger under control. 🥩 Lean Steak: SMASH ✅ Packed with protein to help preserve muscle while losing fat. 🍿 Air-Popped Popcorn: SMASH ✅ High-volume, low-calorie snack that satisfies those salty cravings. 🥣 Granola: PASS ❌ Small portions pack a TON of calories. Easy to overeat without realizing it. 💪 Whey Isolate: SMASH ✅ One of the easiest and most convenient ways to hit your daily protein goal. 🍫 Protein Bars: PASS ❌ Some are basically candy bars with a little extra protein. Check the calories before grabbing one. You don’t need to eliminate your favorite foods to lose fat. You just need to make smarter choices that keep you FULL while staying in a calorie deficit. That’s how you lose 30-50 pounds without feeling like you’re constantly dieting. 🔥 Follow @cohnan for simple fat loss tips that actually fit your busy lifestyle.",
